name: Approved actual OAuth Review preserves human authority and shared spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/approved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART resume
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: campaign live-owned-review-raw-20261010
require-live-snap: 25 live-owned-review-raw-20261010 | approved-job
nav-mode:
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | real-review-running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/approved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART wait
keys: r
require-live-snap: 25 1 completed | completed-review
ask: Does the actual source-only Review remain one fixed job within the six-total request limit, with no model switch or additional investigation?
keys: Escape
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 public-example.env | preserved-human-decision
expect: Owned public documentation example
resize: 160x48
live-snap: review-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: review-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: review-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: review-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: review-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: NPage
live-snap: review-page-40x12
ask: Is the retained human false-positive decision distinguished from the new automated opinion and original scanner evidence across all six viewports?
resize: 120x36
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 REPORT | shared-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/approved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART reported
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 public-example.env | recovered-human-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 REPORT | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/approved_live_review.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the same completed Review, source, context, human decision and request consumption without launching more work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
